<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech July const. output up 17.0 percent yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Czech July const. output up 17.0 percent yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction output in the Czech Republic rose 17.0 percent in July in real terms compared with the same month in 1995, the Czech Statistical Bureau said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>CONSTRUCTION OUTPUT   JULY/96  JUNE/96  JULY/95  JAN-JULY/96</p>
<p>  real pct chg yr/yr   +17.0     +9.4    +10.6	 +5.5</p>
<p>avg nominal monthly</p>
<p>   wages chg yr/yr     +18.9     +9.1    +15.2	+16.0</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
